{"3985540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Raining Lead", "steam_appid": 3985540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985540/extras/e1c796e397166e795f08d55295075716.poster.avif?t=1782873128\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985540/extras/e1c796e397166e795f08d55295075716.webm?t=1782873128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985540/extras/e1c796e397166e795f08d55295075716.mp4?t=1782873128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mega Giga Corp's hostile takeover went beyond the market - they seized an entire city and turned it into one big open office for their private cyber-zombie army</strong>. The government outsources the problem to you - an ex-MGC engineer convinced there's no problem a heavy advanced war machine can't solve. <strong>Big problem? Big robot! Bigger problem? Bigger robot!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985540/extras/df831ceeb29c87d3e794f970168c81af.poster.avif?t=1782873128\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985540/extras/df831ceeb29c87d3e794f970168c81af.webm?t=1782873128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985540/extras/df831ceeb29c87d3e794f970168c81af.mp4?t=1782873128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You start each run in your workshop: unlock new gear, set up your loadout</strong>, and decide who you are today. <strong>A heavy-armored siege-like turtle</strong> with a gatling, picking enemies off from range? <strong>Or a petrol-fuelled pyro robot with barely any plating</strong>, yearning for glory, strapping on a flamethrower, and flooring it straight into a pack of highly-explosive kamikaze cyborgs? <strong>We won't judge</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985540/extras/f4ebdd76984213e877518325923363df.poster.avif?t=1782873128\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985540/extras/f4ebdd76984213e877518325923363df.webm?t=1782873128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985540/extras/f4ebdd76984213e877518325923363df.mp4?t=1782873128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rip new tech from wrecked corporate assets and expand your arsenal</strong>. Lay yours hands on high-caliber autocannons with explosive rounds, flamethrowers, rocket launchers, and more advanced weaponry - each is handled differently and will shape the way you wage your war against the corpo-regime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop your killing machine, choosing your upgrades and picking tactical gear</strong> (ranging from grenades to corrosive acids) as well as secure extra supply drops. Because nothing looks worse on an engineer's résumé than a contracted revolution lost not to overwhelming firepower, but to overlooked supply shortages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985540/extras/8df7fc2cb8d2f3a46b9d5a0081b03b07.poster.avif?t=1782873128\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985540/extras/8df7fc2cb8d2f3a46b9d5a0081b03b07.webm?t=1782873128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985540/extras/8df7fc2cb8d2f3a46b9d5a0081b03b07.mp4?t=1782873128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your battlefield is a hostile urban warzone full of destructible objects and defensive installations</strong>, such as acid barrels, minefields, fortified bunkers, high-caliber turrets, and high-velocity trains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your road to overthrowing the regime, you will fight not only against some cannon fodder - be prepared for augmented troops with anti-tank rockets and hostile war machines!<br> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985540/extras/e1c796e397166e795f08d55295075716.poster.avif?t=1782873128\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985540/extras/e1c796e397166e795f08d55295075716.webm?t=1782873128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985540/extras/e1c796e397166e795f08d55295075716.mp4?t=1782873128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mega Giga Corp's hostile takeover went beyond the market - they seized an entire city and turned it into one big open office for their private cyber-zombie army</strong>. The government outsources the problem to you - an ex-MGC engineer convinced there's no problem a heavy advanced war machine can't solve. <strong>Big problem? Big robot! Bigger problem? Bigger robot!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985540/extras/df831ceeb29c87d3e794f970168c81af.poster.avif?t=1782873128\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985540/extras/df831ceeb29c87d3e794f970168c81af.webm?t=1782873128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985540/extras/df831ceeb29c87d3e794f970168c81af.mp4?t=1782873128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You start each run in your workshop: unlock new gear, set up your loadout</strong>, and decide who you are today. <strong>A heavy-armored siege-like turtle</strong> with a gatling, picking enemies off from range? <strong>Or a petrol-fuelled pyro robot with barely any plating</strong>, yearning for glory, strapping on a flamethrower, and flooring it straight into a pack of highly-explosive kamikaze cyborgs? <strong>We won't judge</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985540/extras/f4ebdd76984213e877518325923363df.poster.avif?t=1782873128\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985540/extras/f4ebdd76984213e877518325923363df.webm?t=1782873128\" type=\"video/webm; code